# Next.js 16.4 (this repo)

**Cache Components** and **Partial Prefetching** are on. Dashboard routes stay request-time — do not set `ensureStatic = "navigation"` on a layout that reads the session.

Training-data Next is **wrong** for this version.

1. **Read first:** `apps/web` → `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` (see [apps/web/AGENTS.md](apps/web/AGENTS.md)).
2. **Never** web-search Next.js APIs or guides.
3. Repo conventions after that: [docs/agents/nextjs.md](docs/agents/nextjs.md), [docs/agents/caching.md](docs/agents/caching.md).
